<title>FRANCE: Bouygues 1996 net dividend unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bouygues 1996 net dividend unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction and public works group Bouygues said in a statement on Tuesday it would propose a 1996 dividend of 25.50 francs including a tax credit of 8.50 francs.</p>
<p>This produces a net dividend of 17 francs, unchanged from the year before.</p>
<p>The group issued provisional 1996 results on January 28 when it said net attributable profit was 650 million francs.</p>
<p>In the Tuesday statement it said the final figure adopted by the board was 654 million francs.</p>
</text>
